OL,3,AProtesters across Spain demand action
OL,4,Aover housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of protesters have taken to
OL,7,Fthe streets across Spain calling for
OL,8,Fgreater protections for tenants after
OL,9,Fthe government failed to get emergency
OL,10,Fhousing legislation through parliament
OL,11,Fon Friday.
OL,13,FAbout 50 planned marches are taking
OL,14,Fplace on Saturday in cities including
OL,15,FMadrid, Valencia and Barcelona.
OL,17,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,18,Fstreets," said a spokesperson for the
OL,19,FValencia Tenants' Union, where a
OL,20,Fdemonstration has already started.
OL,21,FClashes have taken place between some
OL,22,Fprotesters and police in the city.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
