OL,3,AProtesters across Spain demand action
OL,4,Aover housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe measures put forward by Pedro
OL,7,FSanchez's leftist coalition government
OL,8,Fon Friday followed public outcry over
OL,9,Fthe eviction of an 87-year-old woman
OL,10,Ffrom her home last month after she was
OL,11,Funable to afford a sharp rent increase.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
